  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/654/654-36.htm",
  "statuteText": "654:36 Reports of Transfer. –\n\nIf the supervisors of the checklist have received a notice of transfer from any other state or from another board of supervisors of the checklist in the state of New Hampshire through the statewide centralized voter registration database that a voter whose name is on the checklist has been added to the checklist of some other town or city, they shall strike that name from the checklist at the next session for the correction of the checklist. They shall retain the notice in accordance with RSA 33-A:3-a as proof of their reasoning in striking the name from the checklist."
}
